README for qmail

PRE-INSTALL:

  Add the necessary users with the qmail-users.sh script or the
  qmail-users-uid.sh script, if you don't have already
  users/groups with the given UID/GIDs.

CONFIGURING:

  Go to the lifewithqmail.org site to learn how to set up qmail.
  The installing part is already done. I recommend you use
  daemontools to control qmail processes.
